  Segments:
  - Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 36e0db9a8f0f5407be2bca5b64d1435d, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Start: 0.1051
      End: 4.9093
      Chinese: "拆下的头部请放入周转盘，禁止抛掷。"
      English: "Detached heads must be placed in the parts tray, not thrown."
    - Start: 5.5301
      End: 11.2151
      Chinese: "本周已有数台样机被落下的头部击中，跌下承载平台。"
      English: "Several units struck by falling heads have dropped off their support platforms this week."
    - Start: 11.8159
      End: 17.2407
      Chinese: "受损外壳请单独送检，不要混回待包装区。"
      English: "Send damaged casings for inspection rather than returning them to the packing area."
    - Start: 17.5411
      End: 21.4445
      Chinese: "损失将计入对应班组。"
      English: "The resulting losses will be charged to the responsible shift."
    Chinese: ""
    English: ""
